'''Saldean's Farm''' is unique in [[Westfall]] in that it is the only farm aside from the [[Gartside Plot]] that has not been completely taken over by the [[Defias Brotherhood]]. Though Defias [[harvest golem]]s roam the fields, Farmer Saldean and his wife have stubbornly refused to leave.

